    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d159">

                <pb facs="0270" n="182" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg182"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.6374/1144</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chilean Ministry for Foreign Affairs to the
                        American Embassy in Chile</hi><anchor n="64" xml:id="d159-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2221</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>The Ministry of Foreign Affairs, in reference to the final part of the Memorandum
                    transmitted with the <hi rendition="#italic">Note Verbale</hi> of the 3rd of <pb
                        facs="0271" n="183" xml:id="pg183"/> April, has the honor to forward to the
                    Embassy of the United States of America a copy of the resolution adopted
                    unanimously by the Liquidating Commission of the Nitrate Corporation of Chile
                    under date of the 7th instant.</p>
                <p>The Ministry of Foreign Affairs takes advantage of this opportunity to renew to
                    the Embassy of the United States of America the assurance of its highest and
                    most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1933-04-13">April 13,
                            1933</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d159-a1.xml" xpointer="d159-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d159-f1" n="64" type="source" xml:id="d159-f1-content">
                <p>Copy transmitted to the Department by the Ambassador in Chile in his despatch No.
                    1428, April 15; received April 24.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
